Title:  When George introduced the sitar

Seq:    5.7.1.1.7

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Body:

It was such a mind-blower that we had this strange instrument on a record. We were all open to anything when George introduced the sitar: you could walk in with an elephant, as long as it was going to make a musical note. Anything was viable. 
